    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_272_strong_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Phew... It's getting late. Time to go home and sleep...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jaye"
    },
    {
        "text": "This is a great place to run a seafood stand. I can't believe how many customers came through. Hm? Is that...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jaye"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.3
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_243_waaifu_1#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Waai Fu"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_272_strong_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hey.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jaye"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_272_strong_1",
        "name2": "char_243_waaifu_1#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 1,
        "xstrength": 10,
        "ystrength": 12,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true
    },
    {
        "text": "I'll break this arm if I have to.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Waai Fu"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_272_strong_1",
        "name2": "char_243_waaifu_1#4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "It's me, it's me! Let go!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jaye"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_272_strong_1",
        "name2": "char_243_waaifu_1#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Huh? What are you doing here?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Waai Fu"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_272_strong_1",
        "name2": "char_243_waaifu_1#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I just closed up. I'm on my way home.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jaye"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're the one who's here spacing out\u2014\u2014 Well, I guess it's not spacing out if you can flip around and snap my neck like that...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jaye"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_272_strong_1",
        "name2": "char_243_waaifu_1#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Did you hear that car accident just now, up on the overpass?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Waai Fu"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_272_strong_1",
        "name2": "char_243_waaifu_1#4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...aren't you supposed to be studying?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jaye"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_272_strong_1",
        "name2": "char_243_waaifu_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "One must strike a balance between recreation and labor. If I spent the whole night before the exam cramming, I'd go in there with my brain totally fried.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Waai Fu"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_272_strong_1",
        "name2": "char_243_waaifu_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Yeah, sure.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jaye"
    },
    {
        "text": "I heard some customers talking about it. I hope nobody died.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jaye"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_272_strong_1",
        "name2": "char_243_waaifu_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Same... but I heard something at the office. I guess there's some real unsavory characters mixed up in this...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Waai Fu"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_272_strong_1",
        "name2": "char_243_waaifu_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Let's get this out of the way: I have nothing to do with any killers, gangs, or anyone in that world. You know that, right?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jaye"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_272_strong_1",
        "name2": "char_243_waaifu_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Everybody knows your deal\u2014\u2014 Or maybe I should just say, with this attitude of yours, it's natural to be a little suspicious?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Waai Fu"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_272_strong_1",
        "name2": "char_243_waaifu_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...right. I get it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jaye"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_272_strong_1",
        "name2": "char_243_waaifu_1#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "And there was a gas explosion on a highway in the outskirts just two hours ago.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Waai Fu"
    },
    {
        "text": "A gas explosion on a highway? That's a pretty convenient explanation.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Waai Fu"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_272_strong_1",
        "name2": "char_243_waaifu_1#4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Hey, you're not thinking...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jaye"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_272_strong_1",
        "name2": "char_243_waaifu_1#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I told you: one must strike a balance between recreation and labor.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Waai Fu"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_272_strong_1",
        "name2": "char_243_waaifu_1#4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...right. I get it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jaye"
    },
    {
        "text": "So is this recreation or labor?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jaye"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_325_bison_1",
        "name2": "char_213_mostma_1",
        "fadetime": 0.5,
        "focus": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "text": "There we go. They can't do anything downtown like this. Too many people.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mostima"
    },
    {
        "text": "You ordered the matcha, right? This one's yours. My treat.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mostima"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_325_bison_1",
        "name2": "char_213_mostma_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't see any mafia-looking guys, but... aren't we letting our guard down a bit too much?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bison"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_325_bison_1",
        "name2": "char_213_mostma_1#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "What are you talking about? This place is a FIVE STAR recommendation. That's way more awesome than some mobsters.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mostima"
    },
    {
        "text": "You been able to contact Texas and them yet?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mostima"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_325_bison_1",
        "name2": "char_213_mostma_1#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "No, it was so fast...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bison"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_325_bison_1",
        "name2": "char_213_mostma_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "So what's to be all nervous about?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mostima"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_325_bison_1",
        "name2": "char_213_mostma_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bison"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_325_bison_1",
        "name2": "char_213_mostma_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Your ice cream's melting. You gotta calm down already.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mostima"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_325_bison_1",
        "name2": "char_213_mostma_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Er, it's just... nobody could have predicted this. I should calm down.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bison"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_325_bison_1",
        "name2": "char_213_mostma_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "These mobsters came aaall the way from Siracusa to Lungmen. We can bet they're not here for Sauin, right?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mostima"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_325_bison_1",
        "name2": "char_213_mostma_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...They definitely have some other goal. One of them is me, but beyond that, I don't know.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bison"
    },
    {
        "text": "We're in a good position. We managed to lose them. And with just the two of us versus however many of them, we have the advantage in scouting them out...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bison"
    },
    {
        "text": "But how do we proceed? Should we start hunting them? No, the better move is to reconnect with Texas...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bison"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_325_bison_1",
        "name2": "char_213_mostma_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Heh. You seem a lot more like an ordinary Messenger than Texas and the girls.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mostima"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_325_bison_1",
        "name2": "char_213_mostma_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, sorry, was I talking to myself?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bison"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_325_bison_1",
        "name2": "char_213_mostma_1#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "No, you're right.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mostima"
    },
    {
        "text": "We know the mob is up to something, we can't just go off half cocked.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mostima"
    },
    {
        "text": "But sometimes you gotta trust in the girls. I know they can be a little out there, but Penguin Logistics is a tough cookie.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mostima"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's kind of weird to call a logistics firm 'tough,' but... Forget it. It's not like I've got any room to complain.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mostima"
    },
    {
        "text": "Let's just take a walk, enjoy the scenery. And maybe by the time we run into Texas and the crew, they'll have this whole gang war all wrapped up?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mostima"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_325_bison_1",
        "name2": "char_213_mostma_1#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...erm, really?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bison"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_213_mostma_1#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ah...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mostima"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_325_bison_1#2",
        "name2": "char_213_mostma_1#4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Mostima?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bison"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_325_bison_1#2",
        "name2": "char_213_mostma_1#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "You see that candy store?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mostima"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_325_bison_1",
        "name2": "char_213_mostma_1#4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "It's really more of a stall than a store.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bison"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_325_bison_1",
        "name2": "char_213_mostma_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Hm, it is pretty old.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mostima"
    },
    {
        "text": "I came here on a trip to Lungmen years ago.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mostima"
    },
    {
        "text": "Back then... I didn't have any Lungmen dollars on me. Honestly, I must've looked a sight. But still, I found myself drawn to the candy.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mostima"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_325_bison_1",
        "name2": "char_213_mostma_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "O... kay.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bison"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_325_bison_1",
        "name2": "char_213_mostma_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "That's what a Messenger does. We get into trouble on our long and arduous journeys.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mostima"
    },
    {
        "text": "C'mon, let's take a look.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mostima"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_325_bison_1",
        "name2": "char_213_mostma_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bison"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Wow! It's a twinkly star!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Little Girl"
    },
    {
        "text": "Mister, how did you pull a star down here?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Little Girl"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sorry, but that's a secret I'll have to keep.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Man"
    },
    {
        "text": "That's not a star! It's just a candy with some food coloring!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Little Boy"
    },
    {
        "text": "But I've never seen such a pretty candy before... you sure you don't want one?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Little Girl"
    },
    {
        "text": "Y- you're such a pain! Don't they have any cotton candy?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Little Boy"
    },
    {
        "text": "Of course we do. Here, give me your hand.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Man"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh... but I don't want cotton candy. I want that one...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Little Girl"
    },
    {
        "text": "I hate fruity candies! They're too sweet! And they turn your tongue weird colors!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Little Boy"
    },
    {
        "text": "Just take what you want. No charge. For Sauin.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Man"
    },
    {
        "text": "Now it's getting late. You kids hurry home and get to bed!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Man"
    },
    {
        "text": "Thanks, mister!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Little Girl"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hurry up! I wanna go to the toy store and check out the limited Sauin knights they got!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Little Boy"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "text": "Kids these days have so much energy.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Man"
    },
    {
        "text": "Did you want something? We've got these lovely Victorian gumdrops. Real imports. And they come with a candle for Sauin.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Man"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_213_mostma_1#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hmm...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mostima"
    },
    {
        "text": "We're in no hurry. The night is young.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mostima"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ho ho. And so are you. You two must be here for the downtown Carnival.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Man"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_325_bison_1#2",
        "name2": "char_213_mostma_1#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "(Mostima, who is this guy...?)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bison"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_213_mostma_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...you enjoy the nightlife, sir?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mostima"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Not with these old bones I don't. But the candy I sell tends to make its way there for me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Man"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_213_mostma_1#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "Is there something special about this year's Carnival Gala? Looks like a lot of foreign guests in town.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mostima"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Things have been quiet in this town for too many years. The people are definitely itching for the Carnival.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Man"
    },
    {
        "text": "The Carnival brings in all kinds of characters showing up getting into all kinds of trouble. And that's pretty fun, isn't it?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Man"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_213_mostma_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yeah, for sure.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mostima"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "The point of Sauin was always to see off the souls of the departed. If the living are having a good time, that's a decent sacrifice.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Man"
    },
    {
        "text": "You really don't want anything? Last time, you stood outside with your face stuck to the display window. I thought I was gonna have to peel you off.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Man"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_213_mostma_1#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "Wow, you remember me? That's kind of embarrassing.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mostima"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hah. How could I forget?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Man"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_213_mostma_1#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'd love to. But I really can't be eating too many sweets before work.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mostima"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "That's too bad... Ah well, have a good evening, kids.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Man"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_034#10",
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Do come again, when you have time.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Old Man"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_034#10",
        "name2": "char_213_mostma_1#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Yeah. Of course.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mostima"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
