    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_213_mostma_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "The Carnival, huh? I heard it's the biggest festival event for Lungmen in years.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mostima"
    },
    {
        "text": "......Bison?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mostima"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_325_bison_1",
        "name2": "char_213_mostma_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Sorry, I just had something on my mind...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bison"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_325_bison_1",
        "name2": "char_213_mostma_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "It's pretty obvious what you'd be thinking about at a time like this.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mostima"
    },
    {
        "text": "But boy do you love thinking too much. Just go with your gut sometimes.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mostima"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_325_bison_1",
        "name2": "char_213_mostma_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "My gut... even a Messenger like you says to trust your gut?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bison"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_325_bison_1",
        "name2": "char_213_mostma_1#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "You play it case by case. Like right now we're up here on a bridge, and there's a cargo ship passing down below us.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mostima"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_325_bison_1",
        "name2": "char_213_mostma_1#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Okay?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bison"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_325_bison_1",
        "name2": "char_213_mostma_1#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "And we got three disguised mobsters coming at us from both directions.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mostima"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_325_bison_1#2",
        "name2": "char_213_mostma_1#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Wha!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bison"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$darkalley_intro",
        "key": "$darkalley_loop",
        "volume": 0.8,
        "crossfade": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_325_bison_1#2",
        "name2": "char_213_mostma_1#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "It's too late now. They've been watching us for a while.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mostima"
    },
    {
        "text": "Since the candy store.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mostima"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_325_bison_1#2",
        "name2": "char_213_mostma_1#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "We- we're surrounded?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bison"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_325_bison_1#2",
        "name2": "char_213_mostma_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "There's tourists all around us, so we can't fight.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mostima"
    },
    {
        "text": "But I'm not sure these guys have any hangups about that.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mostima"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_325_bison_1#2",
        "name2": "char_213_mostma_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...so what do we do?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bison"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_325_bison_1",
        "name2": "char_213_mostma_1#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Jump.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mostima"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_325_bison_1#2",
        "name2": "char_213_mostma_1#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm sorry?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bison"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_325_bison_1#2",
        "name2": "char_213_mostma_1#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Jump. Now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mostima"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_325_bison_1#2",
        "name2": "char_213_mostma_1#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Off the bridge\u2014\u2014?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bison"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_325_bison_1#2",
        "name2": "char_213_mostma_1#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "There you go with that thinking again. Hop over the railing. Take a leap of faith. Like so\u2014\u2014!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mostima"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_325_bison_1#2",
        "name2": "char_213_mostma_1#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "W- wait a sec\u2014\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bison"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 1.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_325_bison_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Welp! Somehow I feel like this isn't my first time in freefall....",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bison"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's... candy? Why is this freighter hauling candy?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bison"
    },
    {
        "text": "But at least it looks like we lost them, Mostima\u2014\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bison"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bison"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_325_bison_1#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Mostima?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bison"
    },
